From 95013d3ffdf66bfe6d335c0531078914cf4c2a56 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: joemossjr16 <joemossjr16@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 22:45:56 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] nicole: native 2-column landscape backup layout, scaled
 typography, and settings overflow fixes

---
